{"demo_id": "00049_2110_02861.txt::sent::66", "doc_id": "00049_2110_02861.txt", "context_type": "sentence", "sent_idx": 95, "context_text": "We report on benchmarks in neural machine translation (Ott et al., 2018) 2 trained on WMT'16 (Sennrich et al., 2016) and evaluated on en-de WMT'14 (Macháček and Bojar, 2014), large-scale language modeling (Lewis et al., 2021; Brown et al., 2020) and RoBERTa pretraining (Liu et al., 2019) on English CC-100 + RoBERTa corpus (Nagel, 2016; Gokaslan and Cohen, 2019; Zhu et al., 2015; Wenzek et al., 2020), finetuning the pretrained masked language model RoBERTa (Liu et al., 2019) 3 on GLUE (Wang et al., 2018a), ResNet-50 v1.5 image classification (He et al., 2016) 4 on ImageNet-1k (Deng et al., 2009), and Moco v2 contrastive image pretraining and linear finetuning (Chen et al., 2020b) 5 on ImageNet-1k (Deng et al., 2009).", "entities": [{"text": "neural machine translation", "start_token": 2511, "end_token": 2513, "start_char": 14013, "end_char": 14039, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "WMT'16", "start_token": 2525, "end_token": 2525, "start_char": 14072, "end_char": 14078, "ner_label": "Dataset"}, {"text": "en-de WMT'14", "start_token": 2537, "end_token": 2540, "start_char": 14120, "end_char": 14132, "ner_label": "Dataset"}, {"text": "large-scale language modeling", "start_token": 2549, "end_token": 2553, "start_char": 14161, "end_char": 14190, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "RoBERTa pretraining", "start_token": 2570, "end_token": 2571, "start_char": 14236, "end_char": 14255, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "English CC-100", "start_token": 2581, "end_token": 2582, "start_char": 14278, "end_char": 14292, "ner_label": "Dataset"}, {"text": "RoBERTa", "start_token": 2584, "end_token": 2584, "start_char": 14295, "end_char": 14302, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "finetuning", "start_token": 2612, "end_token": 2612, "start_char": 14390, "end_char": 14400, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "pretrained masked language model", "start_token