{"demo_id": "00023_1708_00055.txt::sent::76", "doc_id": "00023_1708_00055.txt", "context_type": "sentence", "sent_idx": 144, "context_text": "Three feature engineered models use Random Forest (RF), Gradient Boosting (GB) and XGBoost (XGB) regression methods with features based on: n-gram overlap; edit distance; longest common prefix/suffix/substring; tree kernels (Moschitti, 2006); word alignments (Sultan et al., 2015); summarization and MT evaluation metrics (BLEU, GTM-3, NIST, WER, ME-TEOR, ROUGE); and kernel similarity of bagsof-words, bags-of-dependencies and pooled wordembeddings.", "entities": [{"text": "Random Forest", "start_token": 3404, "end_token": 3405, "start_char": 18171, "end_char": 18184, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "RF", "start_token": 3407, "end_token": 3407, "start_char": 18186, "end_char": 18188, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "Gradient Boosting", "start_token": 3410, "end_token": 3411, "start_char": 18191, "end_char": 18208, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "GB", "start_token": 3413, "end_token": 3413, "start_char": 18210, "end_char": 18212, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "XGBoost", "start_token": 3416, "end_token": 3416, "start_char": 18218, "end_char": 18225, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "XGB", "start_token": 3418, "end_token": 3418, "start_char": 18227, "end_char": 18230, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "regression", "start_token": 3420, "end_token": 3420, "start_char": 18232, "end_char": 18242, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "n-gram overlap", "start_token": 3427, "end_token": 3430, "start_char": 18275, "end_char": 18289, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "edit distance", "start_token": 3432, "end_token": 3433, "start_char": 18291, "end_char": 18304, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "longest common prefix/suffix/substring", "start_token": 3435, "end_token": 3441, "start_char": 18306, "end_char": 18344, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "tree kernels", "start_token":